','Conversion','Cart → Checkout abandonment up 15.5% month-over-month','Purchase funnel drop-off at Cart → Checkout increased from 33.1% to 38.3% (15.5% change) comparing the last 30 days to the prior 30-day period. Current: 3,053 → 1,885 (38.3% drop). Previous: 154 → 103 (33.1% drop).','medium',0.66,NULL,'new','{\"metric\": \"funnel_cart_to_checkout_dropoff\", \"source\": \"ga4\", \"change_pct\": 15.5, \"current_to\": 1885, \"transition\": \"Cart → Checkout\", \"period_days\": 30, \"previous_to\": 103, \"current_from\": 3053, \"previous_from\": 154, \"current_dropoff\": 38.3, \"previous_dropoff\": 33.1}','2026-07-15 02:00:46','2026-07-15 02:00:46','2026-07-15 02:00:46','internal',0),(17,2,'funnel_overall_conversion_decrease','Conversion','Funnel conversion (View → Purchase) declined 24.4% month-over-month','Overall purchase funnel conversion declined from 1.26% to 0.95% (-24.4% change) comparing the last 30 days to the prior 30-day period.','high',0.87,NULL,'new','{\"metric\": \"funnel_overall_conversion\", \"source\": \"ga4\", \"change_pct\": -24.4, \"period_days\": 30, \"current_rate\": 0.95, \"previous_rate\": 1.26}','2026-07-15 02:00:46','2026-07-15 02:00:46','2026-07-15 02:00:46','internal',0),(18,1,'funnel_overall_conversion_increase','Conversion','Funnel conversion (View → Purchase) improved 233.9% month-over-month','Overall purchase funnel conversion improved from 0.26% to 0.85% (233.9% change) comparing the last 30 days to the prior 30-day period.','critical',0.95,NULL,'new','{\"metric\": \"funnel_overall_conversion\", \"source\": \"ga4\", \"change_pct\": 233.9, \"period_days\": 30, \"current_rate\": 0.85, \"previous_rate\": 0.26}','2026-07-16 02:00:09','2026-07-16 02:00:09','2026-07-16 02:00:09','internal',0),(19,2,'funnel_overall_conversion_increase','Conversion','Funnel conversion (View → Purchase) improved 14.1% month-over-month','Overall purchase funnel conversion improved from 0.90% to 1.03% (14.1% change) comparing the last 30 days to the prior 30-d