lly confirmed she is ready to add eBay and Amazon channels and requested merging JP and Nour\'s accounts into one so she can add her sales team as users. (5) A missing color-coded shipping alert bar in the Magento admin (following the weekend server upgrade) was reported, but it appeared to be working again during the call; the team will monitor it. (6) Website performance is significantly improved after the server upgrade. (7) The bundle products feature was demoed on staging (product page, cart, checkout, order summary, and admin views); Kelly approved deploying as-is, with a future enhancement to let customers remove individual items from kits via checkboxes. Kelly will also consider making rebuild kits customizable bundles. (8) The estimated shipping rules, bundle products, and UPS dimensional text removal will be deployed overnight (delayed by a technical issue), and a mandatory security patch will be applied this week or early next week. (9) Nour will re-investigate an issue where an order showed two prices.','Meeting Summary and Next Steps – Transpart','<p>Hi Kelly,</p><p>Thank you for taking the time to meet with us on Tuesday, July 21, 2026. Here\'s a summary of our discussion and agreed next steps:</p><h3>Key Points Discussed</h3><ul><li><strong>Chatbot review:</strong> We walked through recent chatbot conversations, including a case where a customer was seeking faster shipping. We will perform a deeper analysis of chats to identify what is being answered automatically versus what needs improvement in the flow and content.</li><li><strong>Marketing automation (Klaviyo):</strong> We proposed connecting Klaviyo to trigger automated, event-based emails and customer segmentation as a cost-effective marketing channel. We will investigate available events and options.</li><li><strong>ShipStation integration:</strong> ShipStation data can be surfaced to improve the experience, e.g., estimated delivery dates and potentially rules to support shipping method changes.</li><li><strong>Additional channels (eBay & Amazon):</strong> You confirmed you\'re ready for these channels to be added, as it will significantly reduce double handling.</li><li><strong>Account consolidation:</strong> We will merge our two internal accounts into one so you can add your sales team members as users.</li><li><strong>Bundle products:</strong> We demoed the new bundle product experience on staging (product page, cart, checkout, order summary, and admin view showing included items). You approved deploying as-is.</li><li><strong>Bundle customization:</strong> Allowing customers to remove individual items from a kit (e.g., via checkboxes) is feasible and will require a design update. You will also consider whether rebuild kits should be offered as customizable bundles.</li><li><strong>Admin color-coded shipping bar:</strong> The color-coded shipping alert bar was reported missing yesterday following the weekend server upgrade, but appeared to be working during the call. We will monitor over the next few days.</li><li><strong>Performance:</strong> Site performance has improved noticeably following the server upgrade.</li><li><strong>Order pricing issue:</strong> We will re-check the issue where an order displayed two prices.</li></ul><h3>Decisions Made</h3><ul><li>Deploy the bundle products feature as-is; the option to remove individual kit items will follow as a separate design update.</li><li>Deploy the estimated shipping rules and removal of the UPS dimensional text overnight (delayed today due to a technical issue).</li><li>Merge our two internal accounts into one to free a user seat for your sales team.</li><li>Proceed with planning to add eBay and Amazon channels.</li><li>Apply the mandatory security patch this week or early next week.</li></ul><h3>Action Items</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><th>Action</th><th>Owner</th><th>Due Date</th></tr><tr><td>Deploy estimated shipping rules, bundle products, and UPS text removal (overnight deployment)</td><td>Nour Ayman</td><td>July 22, 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Merge internal accounts into one so sales team users can be added</td><td>Nour Ayman</td><td>Next few days</td></tr><tr><td>Deeper analysis of chatbot conversations and flow improvements</td><td>Nour Ayman</td><td>TBD</td></tr><tr><td>Investigate Klaviyo events and integration options</td><td>Jean Paul Hanna</td><td>TBD</td></tr><tr><td>Re-check the order showing two prices</td><td>Nour Ayman</td><td>TBD</td></tr><tr><td>Apply mandatory security patch</td><td>Nour Ayman</td><td>By early next week</td></tr><tr><td>Monitor the color-coded shipping bar in admin and report if it goes missing again</td><td>Kelly Hufford</td><td>Ongoing</td></tr><tr><td>Consider whether rebuild kits should be offered as customizable bundle products</td><td>Kelly Hufford</td><td>TBD</td></tr></table><h3>Open Questions</h3><ul><li>Timing and plan for adding the eBay and Amazon channels.</li><li>Whether a chatbot workflow can route faster-shipping requests on existing orders to a specific team member (e.g., McKenna).</li><li>Which Klaviyo events are available for the proposed automated marketing scenarios.</li><li>Root cause of the order displaying two prices.</li><li>Root cause of the temporarily missing color-coded shipping bar in the admin panel.</li></ul><h3>Next Steps / Next Meeting</h3><p>We\'ll complete the overnight deployment and continue with the items above. We\'ll reconvene at our next weekly meeting to review progress, including the chatbot analysis and channel planning.</p><p>Please don\'t hesitate to reach out if anything needs clarification.</p><p>Best,<br>The Technopath Team</p>',NULL,NULL,'[{\"title\": \"Deploy estimated shipping rules, bundle products, and UPS dimensional text removal (overnight deployment)\", \"due_date\": \"2026-07-22\", \"owner_name\": \"Nour Ayman\", \"is_customer_facing\": true}, {\"title\": \"Merge JP and Nour\'s internal accounts into one so Kelly can add her sales t