ad, to be explored via targeted marketing campaigns as a future opportunity. On automated support, the team reviewed chatbot conversations (including a case where a customer wanted faster shipping), and Nour will perform a deep analysis of chat logs to distinguish automated vs. manual responses and improve the flow. Jean Paul introduced Klaviyo (\'Clavio\') for event-based segmented marketing emails and ShipStation integration to surface shipping information, rules, and estimated delivery dates. The bundled product functionality was demoed on staging (product page, cart, checkout, order summary, and admin views) and will be deployed to production overnight along with estimated shipping rules and removal of the UPS dimensional text; a future enhancement will allow customers to uncheck/remove individual items from bundles, and Kelly will consider whether rebuild kits should be made customizable the same way. Kelly requested merging her two accounts into one so she can add her sales team as users, and confirmed she is ready for eBay and Amazon channels to be added when the team is ready. The color-coded shipping alerts in the Magento admin, which were missing after the weekend server upgrade, were verified as working again during the call and will be monitored. A mandatory security hotfix will be deployed this week or early next week. Site performance improvements following the server work were also confirmed.','Meeting Summary and Next Steps – Transpart','<p>Hi Kelly,</p><p>Thank you for taking the time to meet with us on Wednesday, July 22, 2026. Here\'s a summary of our discussion and agreed next steps:</p><h3>Key Points Discussed</h3><ul><li><strong>International growth opportunity:</strong> We discussed a potential B2B supplier model to distribute parts kits internationally for American car owners, to be validated later through targeted marketing campaigns.</li><li><strong>Chatbot &amp; support flow:</strong> We reviewed recent chatbot conversations, including a case where a customer wanted faster shipping, and will analyze chat logs to improve automated responses and information quality.</li><li><strong>Marketing automation:</strong> We proposed connecting Klaviyo to send automated, segmented marketing emails based on customer events.</li><li><strong>ShipStation integration:</strong> Connecting ShipStation will surface shipping information, rules, and estimated delivery dates to improve the customer experience.</li><li><strong>Bundled products:</strong> We demoed the bundled product functionality on staging, including how included items now display on the product page, cart, checkout, order summary, and admin order views. The UPS dimensional text has been removed as requested.</li><li><strong>Bundle customization:</strong> A future enhancement will allow customers to remove individual items from kits (e.g., via checkboxes), and we discussed extending this to rebuild kits.</li><li><strong>Accounts &amp; channels:</strong> We will merge your two accounts into one so you can add your sales team as users, and you confirmed you\'re ready for eBay and Amazon channels to be added when we are.</li><li><strong>Admin shipping alerts:</strong> The color-coded shipping alerts in the admin panel, which were missing after the weekend server upgrade, were verified as working again during the call and will be monitored over the next few days.</li><li><strong>Performance &amp; security:</strong> Site performance has significantly improved following the server upgrade, and a mandatory security hotfix will be deployed this week or early next week.</li></ul><h3>Decisions Made</h3><ul><li>Deploy the bundled product functionality and estimated shipping rules to production as-is (overnight deployment), with the item-removal checkbox enhancement to follow later.</li><li>Remove the UPS dimensional text from the storefront as part of the deployment.</li><li>Proceed with merging your accounts into one so sales team members can be added as users.</li><li>Deploy the mandatory security hotfix this week or early next week.</li><li>Keep the international B2B supplier model on the roadmap as a potential future target market.</li></ul><h3>Action Items</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><th>Action Item</th><th>Owner</th><th>Due Date</th></tr><tr><td>Analyze chat logs to identify automated vs. manual responses and improve the chatbot flow</td><td>Nour Ayman</td><td>TBD</td></tr><tr><td>Establish Klaviyo connection for event-based automated marketing emails</td><td>Jean Paul Hanna</td><td>TBD</td></tr><tr><td>Integrate ShipStation to display shipping information and rules</td><td>Jean Paul Hanna</td><td>TBD</td></tr><tr><td>Investigate why certain orders appear as 2 separate items instead of 1</td><td>Nour Ayman</td><td>TBD</td></tr><tr><td>Merge user accounts into one for the sales team</td><td>Nour Ayman</td><td>July 27, 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Deploy mandatory security hotfix to the server</td><td>Nour Ayman</td><td>July 27, 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Deploy bundled products, estimated shipping rules, and UPS text removal to production (overnight)</td><td>Jean Paul Hanna / Nour Ayman</td><td>July 23, 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Monitor color-coded shipping alerts in admin over the next few days to confirm they remain functional</td><td>Team / Kelly</td><td>TBD</td></tr><tr><td>Consider whether rebuild kits (e.g., deluxe level two kits) should be made customizable as bundled products</td><td>Kelly Hufford</td><td>TBD</td></tr></table><h3>Open Questions</h3><ul><li>Which customer event segments are available in Klaviyo for automated email triggers (to be confirmed during setup).</li><li>Whether a chatbot workflow can be built so customers requesting faster shipping on existing orders are automatically assigned to McKenna.</li><li>Root cause of orders appearing as two separate items instead of one (under investigation).</li><li>Whether rebuild kits should be converted to customizable bundled products (pending your review of the bill of materials scenarios).</li><li>Timing for adding eBay and Amazon channels (you\'re ready whenever we are — we\'ll propose a plan).</li></ul><h3>Next Steps</h3><p>We\'ll proceed with the overnight deployment and the items above, and continue our regular weekly meeting cadence. We\'ll keep you updated on the security patch and integration progress.</p><p>Please don\'t hesitate to reach out if anything needs clarification.</p><p>Best,<br>The Technopath Team</p>',NULL,NULL,'[{\"title\": \"Establish connection with Klaviyo for automated marketing emails based on customer event segments\", \"due_date\": null, \"owner_name\": \"Jean Paul Hanna\", \"is_customer_facing\": false}, {\"title\": \"Integrate ShipStation to display shipping information and rules in the system\", \"due_date\": null, \"owner_name\": \"Jean Paul Hanna\", \"is_customer_facing\": false}, {\"title\": \"Investigate why certain orders appear as 2 separate items instead of 1\", \"due_date\": null, \"owner_name\": \"Nour Ayman\", \"is_customer_facing\": false}, {\"title\": \"Merge Kelly\'s two user accounts into one so she can add her sales team as users\", \"due_date\": \"2026-07-27\", \"owner_name\": \"Nour Ayman\", \"is_customer_facing\": true}, {\"title\": \"Deploy mandatory security hotfix to the server\", \"due_date\": \"2026-07-27\", \"owner_name\": \"Nour Ayman\", \"is_customer_facing\": false}, {\"title\": \"Deploy bundled products, estimated shipping rules, and UPS dimensional text removal to production (overnight deployment)\", \"due_date\": \"2026-07-23\", \"owner_name\": \"Jean Paul Hanna\", \"is_customer_facing\": true}, {\"title\": \"Monitor color-coded shipping alerts in the admin panel over the next few days to confirm they remain functional after the server upgrade\", \"due_date\": null, \"owner_name\": \"Nour Ayman\", \"is_customer_facing\": true}, {\"title\": \"Consider whether rebuild kits (e.g., deluxe level two kits) should be made customizable as bundled products\", \"due_date\": null, \"owner_name\": \"Kelly Hufford\", \"is_customer_facing\": true}]','\"Deploy the bundled product functionality and estimated shipping rules to production as-is via an overnight deployment, with the item-removal (checkbox) enhancement to follow later\\nRemove the UPS dimensional text from the storefront as part of the deployment\\nProceed with merging Kelly\'s two accounts into one so sales team members can be added as users\\nDeploy the mandatory security hotfix this week or early next week\\nProceed with connecting Klaviyo for event-based automated marketing emails\\nProceed with integrating ShipStation to display shipping information and rules\\nKeep the international B2B supplier model (parts kits for American car owners abroad) as a potential future target market, to be tested via focused marketing campaigns\\nKelly confirmed she is ready for eBay and Amazon channels to be added when the team is ready\"','\"Which customer event segments are available in Klaviyo for triggering automated emails (Jean Paul to investigate during setup)\\nWhether a chatbot workflow can be built to automatically assign customers requesting faster shipping on existing orders to McKenna\\nRoot cause of certain orders appearing as 2 separate items instead of 1 (Nour to investigate)\\nWhether rebuild kits (including deluxe level two kits) should be made customizable as bundled products (Kelly to think on it further)\\nSpecific timing/plan for adding the eBay and Amazon channels\\nWhether the color-coded shipping alerts issue after the server upgrade is fully resolved (working during the call; to be monitored over the next few days)\\nHow the shared admin account OTP would be handled if the team eventually shares an account with Kelly (alternative methods like additional email/phone or Google Authenticator mentioned)\"',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'openrouter','~anthropic/claude-fable-latest',NULL,'2026-07-21 21:17:57',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-21 21:16:20','2026-07-21 2