larify how shop categories are currently defined and managed on the platform. Due date: Not specified.</li><li><strong>Irem Aydin:</strong> Review and refine product groupings to remove irrelevant categories and prioritize key items. Due date: Not specified.</li></ul><h3>Open Questions</h3><ul><li>What input is required from Muhammad to complete the bank transfer functionality update?</li><li>How are shop categories currently defined and managed on the platform?</li><li>What estimates will be provided for configurable product defaults implementation?</li><li>When will the Midsummer product page design be available for review?</li><li>What are the final product codes and price display changes to be sent to the development team?</li></ul><h3>Next Steps / Next Meeting</h3><p>The teams will complete the actions above, continue staging QA and B2B cache validation, and coordinate on the Midsummer design request. No date for the next meeting was specified.</p><p>Please don\'t hesitate to reach out if anything needs clarification.</p><p>Best,</p>','Meeting Summary and Next Steps – Cambro','<p><br></p>','[{\"title\": \"Send an Excel sheet containing current tasks, priorities, and hours spent or estimated\", \"due_date\": null, \"owner_name\": \"Nour Ayman\", \"is_customer_facing\": true}, {\"title\": \"Review the shared Excel sheet and define priority levels for all listed tasks\", \"due_date\": null, \"owner_name\": \"Irem Aydin\", \"is_customer_facing\": true}, {\"title\": \"Verify the standardized category order on the website across the three countries\", \"due_date\": null, \"owner_name\": \"Benoit Courcelle\", \"is_customer_facing\": true}, {\"title\": \"Perform a bulk update of Italia product titles using the provided list\", \"due_date\": null, \"owner_name\": \"Nour Ayman\", \"is_customer_facing\": false}, {\"title\": \"Share a screenshot of the product variant clicking issue on the product listing page\", \"due_date\": null, \"owner_name\": \"Nour Ayman\", \"is_cus