dium\"}], \"needs_customer_input\": [], \"completed_since_last_meeting\": [{\"key\": \"TRAN-1289\", \"status\": \"Done\", \"summary\": \"Reconcile out-of-stock flag with actual storefront behavior\", \"updated\": \"2026-07-19T04:50:01.990-0400\", \"assignee\": \"Nour eldin ayman\", \"priority\": \"Medium\"}, {\"key\": \"TRAN-1108\", \"status\": \"Done\", \"summary\": \"Code Review and Deployment\", \"updated\": \"2026-07-18T06:54:38.389-0400\", \"assignee\": \"Mostafa Naguib\", \"priority\": \"Medium\"}, {\"key\": \"TRAN-1107\", \"status\": \"Done\", \"summary\": \"Login as Customer Redirects to Login Page Instead of Frontend Session (Production Only)\", \"updated\": \"2026-07-18T06:54:14.147-0400\", \"assignee\": \"Mostafa Naguib\", \"priority\": \"Medium\"}, {\"key\": \"TRAN-1284\", \"status\": \"Done\", \"summary\": \"Deploy AI Chatbot to Production and Initialize Optimization\", \"updated\": \"2026-07-17T09:46:46.061-0400\", \"assignee\": \"Nour eldin ayman\", \"priority\": \"Highest\"}, {\"key\": \"TRAN-1285\", \"status\": \"Done\", \"summary\": \"Dry run test\", \"updated\": \"2026-07-17T07:44:12.713-0400\", \"assignee\": \"Nour eldin ayman\", \"priority\": \"Medium\"}, {\"key\": \"TRAN-1263\", \"status\": \"Done\", \"summary\": \"Add \\\"Add to Cart\\\" button to Featured Products\", \"updated\": \"2026-07-13T13:07:01.845-0400\", \"assignee\": \"Nour eldin ayman\", \"priority\": \"Highest\"}]}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'openrouter','~anthropic/claude-fable-latest',NULL,'2026-07-21 21:01:07',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-21 20:57:00','2026-07-21 21:01:07'),(2,9,'CMBR2','project = CMBR2 AND updated >= \'2026-07-07\' ORDER BY updated DESC','PROJECT HEALTH: Overall healthy. 8 tickets completed since last meeting, 16 in active development/ready-for-dev, 2 in backlog, 27 total tracked. No items formally flagged as awaiting customer input, but a few backlog items would benefit from client prioritization.\n\nCOMPLETED SINCE LAST MEETING (8):\n- CMBR2-2177 (Highest): Post-deployment visual regressions on navigation menus (de-de Desktop & en-de Mobile) — resolved by Nour.\n- CMBR2-2182 (Highest): Admin grid/tree components failing on Staging (CMS Pages empty, Categories not loading) — resolved by JP.\n- CMBR2-2180: Missing \'Colore\' filter in Trays (Vassoi) category — Nour.\n- CMBR2-2183: Product 32CV1335 failing to load on frontend — Nour.\n- CMBR2-2176: Product images for SKU EPP4060FNR110 not displaying — Nour.\n- CMBR2-2166: \'Starting From\' price localization for IT and DE sites — Nour.\n- CMBR2-2143: Excessive white space on Italian PLP product grid — Nour.\n- CMBR2-2099: Product Code/URL not updating on OUT OF STOCK variant selection — Nour.\n\nIN PROGRESS (16 incl. Ready For Dev):\n- CMBR2-2091 (Highest, Mostafa): Adobe Commerce Security Patch APSB26-49 — top priority, most recently updated. Have timeline ready for client.\n- CMBR2-2174 (Highest, JP): B2B VAT pricing display bug — in REWORK status. RISK: This failed QA/review and needs rework; be prepared to explain revised timeline if asked.\n- CMBR2-2169 (High, Mostafa): Deployment process optimization.\n- CMBR2-2175 (JP): Automated weekly stock report for Benoit — good talking point since Benoit is an attendee; confirm delivery format/recipients.\n- CMBR2-2181 (JP): CookieBot on Magento site; CMBR2-2184 (JP): Cookie banner acceptance-rate optimization — related workstreams.\n- CMBR2-2185 (JP): Homepage \'New Products\' carousel CTA updates (IT, EN, DE).\n- CMBR2-2186, CMBR2-2179, CMBR2-2173, CMBR2-2123, CMBR2-1853 (Donia): Frontend/UX fixes (color filter improvements, Confezione button truncation, PLP variant redirect, mini-cart font rendering, mobile menu \'X\' characters).\n- CMBR2-2168 (Nour): TestMui automated testing setup for 6 regional sites.\n- CMBR2-2172 (Nour): SEO category introductory text updates.\n- CMBR2-2170 (Nour): Active product export for de-de/it-it bulk title updates.\n- CMBR2-2171 (Nour): JS issues — in QA ON PROD; confirm sign-off status before meeting.\n\nBLOCKED / BACKLOG (2):\n- CMBR2-2178: De-emphasize out-of-stock products on PLPs — reason for backlog status [Information Not Available]; consider asking client for prioritization.\n- CMBR2-1499: Contact Us language switch redirects to homepage — long-standing backlog item; confirm priority with client.\n\nNEEDS CUSTOMER INPUT: None formally flagged in Jira. Recommend soliciting client direction on the two backlog items and confirming stock report requirements with Benoit.\n\nRISKS & WATCH ITEMS:\n1. CMBR2-2174 (VAT display for B2B) is Highest priority and in REWORK — highest-risk item; align internally on messaging and revised ETA before the call.\n2. Security patch APSB26-49 is time-sensitive; confirm deployment window with Mostafa.\n3. Two Highest-priority issues were resolved since last meeting (nav regressions, staging admin) — good news to lead with.\n\nKEY TALKING POINTS:\n1. Lead with strong delivery velocity: 8 items closed including two Highest-priority fixes.\n2. Give clear status on the security patch and expected completion.\n3. Proactively address VAT pricing rework with a plan (avoid surprises).\n4. Confirm stock report details directly with Benoit.\n5. Ask client to prioritize the two backlog items.\n6. Preview automated testing (TestMui) and deployment optimization as quality/reliability investments.\n\nNOTE: Meeting date is listed as July 15, 2026, but the Jira snapshot is dated July 21, 2026 — some ticket updates post-date the stated meeting date. Verify meeting date/context with the team.','Status Update Before Our Meeting – Cambro / Cambroshop.com','<p>Hi Benoit,</p><p>Ahead of our meeting on Wednesday, July 15, 2026, here\'s a quick summary of where things stand:</p><p><strong>Completed Since Last Meeting</strong></p><ul><li>Resolved the visual issues on the navigation menus that appeared after the recent deployment (German desktop and mobile).</li><li>Fixed the admin issue on the staging environment where CMS pages and categories were not loading.</li><li>Restored the missing Color filter in the Trays (Vassoi) category.</li><li>Fixed a product that was not loading correctly on the storefront.</li><li>Resolved missing product images on a product page.</li><li>Updated the \"Starting From\" price display for the Italian and German websites.</li><li>Fixed the layout spacing issue on the Italian product listing pages.</li><li>Corrected product code and URL behavior when selecting out-of-stock variants.</li></ul><p><strong>Currently In Progress</strong></p><ul><li>Applying the latest Adobe Commerce security patch to keep the platform protected (top priority).</li><li>Correcting how prices display for B2B customers so VAT is handled properly.</li><li>Setting up the automated weekly stock report to be delivered to you, Benoit.</li><li>Implementing cookie consent improvements, including work to improve the cookie banner acceptance rate.</li><li>Updating the call-to-action buttons on the homepage \"New Products\" carousel across the Italian, English, and German sites.</li><li>A set of frontend refinements: color filter improvements, button text fixes, product variant navigation on listing pages, and mobile menu polish.</li><li>Setting up automated testing across the six regional websites to improve quality and catch issues earlier.</li><li>SEO updates to category introductory texts and preparing product exports for bulk title updates on the German and Italian stores.</li><li>Improvements to our deployment process for faster, more reliable releases.</li></ul><p><strong>Items Needing Your Input</strong></p><ul><li>We\'d like your input on prioritizing the de-emphasis of out-of-stock products on listing pages.</li><li>We\'d also like to confirm the priority of the fix for language switching on the Contact Us page, which currently redirects to the homepage.</li></ul><p><strong>Proposed Agenda</strong></p><ol><li>Review of completed work and recent fixes</li><li>Security patch status and timeline</li><li>B2B pricing (VAT display) update</li><li>Weekly stock report — confirm requirements and recipients</li><li>Cookie consent and homepage updates</li><li>Prioritization of open items needing your input</li><li>Next steps and upcoming priorities</li></ol><p>Please let us know if you\'d like to add anything to the agenda. Looking forward to speaking with you.</p><p>Best,</p>',NULL,NULL,'\"1. Welcome & review of completed work since last meeting — highlight resolved navigation regressions and staging admin fix (15 min)\\n2. Adobe Commerce security patch APSB26-49 — status and deployment timeline (15 min)\\n3. B2B VAT pricing display — rework status and revised plan (15 min)\\n4. Weekly automated stock report — confirm format, recipients, and delivery schedule with Benoit (15 min)\\n5. Cookie consent workstream (CookieBot implementation & banner acceptance optimization) and homepage carousel CTA updates (15 min)\\n6. Quality initiatives — automated testing setup across 6 regional sites and deployment process optimization (15 min)\\n7. Client prioritization needed — out-of-stock product de-emphasis and Contact Us language-switch fix (15 min)\\n8. Open questions, next steps, and scheduling (15 min)\"','{\"other\": [{\"key\": \"CMBR2-2171\", \"status\": \"QA ON PROD\", \"summary\": \"Resolving JS issues\", \"updated\": \"2026-07-13T16:41:05.749-0400\", \"assignee\": \"Nour eldin ayman\", \"priority\": \"Medium\"}], \"in_progress\": [{\"key\": \"CMBR2-2091\", \"status\": \"In Progress\", \"summary\": \"Apply Adobe Commerce / Magento Security Patch APSB26-49\", \"updated\": \"2026-07-21T14:14:30.182-0400\", \"assignee\": \"Mostafa Naguib\", \"priority\": \"Highest\"}, {\"key\": \"CMBR2-2169\", \"status\": \"In Progress\", \"summary\": \"Optimize Deployment Process\", \"updated\": \"2026-07-21T04:24:37.428-0400\", \"assignee\": \"Mostafa Naguib\", \"priority\": \"High\"}, {\"key\": \"CMBR2-2186\", \"status\": \"Ready For Dev\", \"summary\": \"Improve Color Filter Component (Accessibili