mark Members — UNASSIGNED\n- USG-1201: Update SKU limit in deal bulk import — UNASSIGNED\n- USG-1175: Hierarchy Restructure — UNASSIGNED\n- USG-1185: Unify Terminologies Across the System — UNASSIGNED\n- USG-1169: Code Improvements — UNASSIGNED\n- USG-1193: Deal Import Speed and Performance — UNASSIGNED\n- USG-1151: Order Bulk Import Refactoring (Donia Khaled)\n- USG-1150: Order Bulk Import Validation (Donia Khaled)\n- USG-961: [USG-870] Staging Internal Testing (Donia Khaled)\n- USG-924: Update to use Firebear (Donia Khaled)\n- USG-20: Project Management (Donia Khaled) — ongoing\n\nBLOCKED / ON HOLD:\n- USG-866: Deals Bulk Import Feedback — Backlog, unassigned; may need client feedback to progress\n- USG-1166: Create PO to work on PO level in bulk import — On Hold (Donia Khaled); likely requires a client PO/commercial decision\n- USG-1152: Admin Tools App Support and Refactoring — On Hold (Donia Khaled)\n\nREADY FOR DEPLOYMENT:\n- USG-1163: Pepsi Conflict SKUs to be comma separated — confirm whether this is included in the 7/22 deployment.\n\nNEEDS CUSTOMER INPUT: No items explicitly flagged in Jira, but USG-1166 (PO creation for PO-level bulk import work) and USG-866 (Deals Bulk Import Feedback) likely require client action/decision — confirm with the team before the meeting.\n\nRISKS & CONCERNS:\n1. Live Deployment on 7/22/26 is the day after this meeting — confirm readiness, deployment window, downtime communication (503 downtime message work is done, which supports this), and rollback plan.\n2. Six active items are UNASSIGNED (USG-1200, USG-1201, USG-1175, USG-1185, USG-1169, USG-1193) — resource allocation risk; assign owners before or immediately after the meeting.\n3. Two On Hold items assigned to Donia — clarify hold reasons and whether client-side action (e.g., PO approval) is the blocker.\n4. Confirm scope of 7/22 deployment: which tickets ship (e.g., USG-1163)?\n\nKEY TALKING POINTS:\n- Walk through 7/22 deployment plan, timing, and expected downtime messaging.\n- Confirm server upgrade go-live sequencing (USG-1199) relative to the 7/22 deployment.\n- Raise the PO-level bulk import work (USG-1166) — determine if client needs to issue a PO to unblock.\n- Request client feedback on Deals Bulk Import (USG-866).\n- Internally: assign owners to the six unassigned in-progress tickets.','Status Update Before Our Meeting – USG','<p>Hi Nicole,</p><p>Ahead of our meeting on Tuesday, July 21, 2026, here\'s a quick summary of where things stand:</p><p><strong>Completed Since Last Meeting</strong></p><ul><li>Adjusted city abbreviation handling in the user import process</li><li>Completed follow-up work on the server upgrade/migration</li><li>Updated the maintenance page to display a clear downtime message during deployments</li><li>Completed the bulk import work</li><li>Completed the Pepsi Partners audit</li></ul><p><strong>Currently In Progress</strong></p><ul><li>Preparing for the live deployment scheduled for July 22, 2026</li><li>Server upgrade go-live preparation</li><li>Automated product logic to hide Pepsi deals from Aramark members</li><li>Updating the SKU limit in the deal bulk import</li><li>Hierarchy restructure</li><li>Unifying terminology across the system</li><li>Order bulk import validation and refinements</li><li>Deal import speed and performance improvements</li><li>Ongoing code quality improvements and internal staging testing</li></ul><p><strong>Blockers / Items Needing Your Input</strong></p><ul><li>PO-level bulk import work is currently on hold — we\'d like to discuss next steps and what\'s needed to move this forward</li><li>We\'re awaiting your feedback on the deals bulk import so we can plan the next round of refinements</li></ul><p><strong>Items Ready for Review</strong></p><ul><li>One update related to Pepsi conflict SKU formatting is ready for deployment — we\'ll confirm timing during our meeting</li></ul><p><strong>Proposed Agenda</strong></p><ol><li>Review of completed work and recent progress</li><li>July 22 deployment plan — timing, expected downtime, and communications</li><li>Server upgrade go-live status and next steps</li><li>Items needing your input: PO-level bulk import work and deals bulk import feedback</li><li>Upcoming priorities and next steps</li></ol><p>Please let us know if you\'d like to add anything to the agenda. Looking forward to speaking with you.</p><p>Best,</p>',NULL,NULL,'\"1. Welcome & review of completed work since last meeting (5-10 min)\\n2. July 22, 2026 live deployment plan — scope, timing, downtime messaging, and go/no-go confirmation (15-20 min)\\n3. Server upgrade go-live status and sequencing (10-15 min)\\n4. In-progress items walkthrough — bulk import improvements, hierarchy restructure, terminology unification, Pepsi/Aramark product logic (15 min)\\n5. Items needing client input — PO-level bulk import work (on hold) and deals bulk import feedback (10-15 min)\\n6. Upcoming priorities, open questions, and next steps (5-10 min)\"','{\"other\": [{\"key\": \"USG-1163\", \"status\": \"Ready for Deployment\", \"summary\": \"Pepsi Conflict SKUs to be comma seperated\", \"updated\": \"2026-07-21T07:12:09.258-0400\", \"assignee\": \"Unassigned\", \"priority\": \"Medium\"}], \"in_progress\": [{\"key\": \"USG-1198\", \"status\": \"Ready for Dev\", \"summary\": \"Live Deployment 7/22/26\", \"updated\": \"2026-07-21T14:17:50.672-0400\", \"assignee\": \"Mostafa Naguib\", \"priority\": \"Medium\"}, {\"key\": \"USG-20\", \"status\": \"In Progress\", \"summary\": \"Project Management\", \"updated\": \"2026-07-21T09:44:30.278-0400\", \"assignee\": \"Donia Khaled\", \"priority\": \"Lowest\"}, {\"key\": \"USG-1200\", \"status\": \"In Progress\", \"summary\": \"Automated Product Logic - Hide Pepsi Deals from Aramark Members\", \"updated\": \"2026-07-21T08:32:31.468-0400\", \"assignee\": \"Unassigned\", \"priority\": \"Medium\"}, {\"key\": \"USG-1201\", \"status\": \"In Progress\", \"summary\": \"Update SKU limit in deal bulk import\", \"updated\"